---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | UrsusData"
  description="Learn how UrsusData collects, uses, and protects information when you visit this website or contact us."
>
  <main class="legal-content">
    <section class="hero">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="lead">Last updated: October 14, 2026</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section block">
      <p>This policy describes how UrsusData LLC (“UrsusData,” “we,” or “us”) handles information when you visit ursusdata.com or contact us. It applies to this website and not to services we provide to clients under separate agreements.</p>
      <h2>Information you provide</h2>
      <p>If you contact us by email or through the contact form, we receive the information you choose to send, such as your name, email address, and project details. Please do not include sensitive personal information in a project inquiry.</p>
      <h2>How we use information</h2>
      <p>We use inquiry information to respond to you, discuss potential work, and operate and protect the website. We do not sell personal information.</p>
      <h2>Service providers and cookies</h2>
      <p>The contact form is delivered using EmailJS, and the website uses Cookiebot to manage cookie preferences. These providers may process information or technical data to provide their services under their own terms and privacy notices. Your browser may also provide basic technical information when requesting this site. Cookie choices can be managed through the consent controls shown on the website.</p>
      <h2>Retention and security</h2>
      <p>We retain correspondence for as long as reasonably necessary to respond, maintain business records, and meet applicable obligations. We use reasonable safeguards, but no internet transmission or storage method can be guaranteed to be completely secure.</p>
      <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
      <p>Depending on where you live, you may have rights to request access, correction, deletion, or other treatment of your personal information. To make a request, contact <a href="mailto:privacy@ursusdata.com">privacy@ursusdata.com</a>. We may need to verify your request and may retain information where the law permits or requires it.</p>
      <h2>Children and external websites</h2>
      <p>This website is intended for business audiences and is not directed to children under 13. It may link to third-party websites that are governed by their own privacy practices.</p>
      <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time by posting a revised version here. Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href="mailto:privacy@ursusdata.com">privacy@ursusdata.com</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
